---
name: Sysmon Winlogbeat JSON → canonical event → OCSF
description: |
  Adapt a structured Winlogbeat event to the canonical Windows Event Log
  schema before mapping it to OCSF.
---

from_file "sysmon-winlogbeat.ndjson" {
  read_ndjson
}
// The canonicalizer recognizes the `winlog` object and delegates to the
// Winlogbeat adapter. If `include_xml` is enabled, you can instead normalize
// `event.original` to use the original Windows Event Log XML.
sysmon::canonicalize this, sysmon
sysmon::ocsf::map sysmon, ocsf
ocsf.metadata.log_format = "json"
this = move ocsf
ocsf_derive
ocsf_cast
